5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I want to avoid assumptions. Let’s look at the fortnight's tally of use by person and the final clear-out of the old fridge.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’d like to check the partition wall to the office and where the last awkward conversation happened.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I’m picking the round trip for a hot lunch and the invoices for outside hire by the hour.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I’m taking the quotes for the two fit-outs and the facilities callouts on this floor. Numbers first, opinions later.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I will examine the crumbs and bins at the desks, and the unplanned talk since the refit.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I appreciate the direct approach. Let’s see what the data says before we speculate.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. The data will help us understand the space better.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,Love the energy. Let’s see if the numbers match the chaos.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"May, “chaos” is a strong word. I prefer “unquantified variables.” We’ll see which one the invoices support.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Shunichi, your precision is admirable. Yet sometimes the mess is the message. Let us listen to what the room itself is trying to tell us.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Servas, the room cannot speak. We must rely on the tally to see who actually uses it, not who claims to.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I find the idea of the room speaking quite poetic, though perhaps a bit abstract for our practical needs.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"Jonathan, poetry is lovely, but I’m hungry. Let’s see if the lunch route is actually killing my afternoon.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"May, hunger is a variable, not a strategy. I’m checking the fit-out quotes to see if we can actually afford the space we’re fighting over.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"May, hunger is a signal, not a strategy. Let us see if the crumbs reveal a pattern of neglect or simply a lack of time.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
