35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The tally shows two people used it eleven times, others four. The fridge clearing was done twice by one person. Facts, not feelings.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The partition is just plasterboard. We can hear everything. That awkward talk happened right here, in front of everyone.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"Twenty-five minutes for lunch, plus sixty-eight thousand yen in outside hire. We’re paying for space we barely use.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Four hundred and seventy-seven thousand yen total. Eleven callouts, zero for the empty room. We are paying for noise and clutter.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The crumbs show we eat where we sit. The unplanned talk has vanished to the printer. We are isolated by our own habits.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"The data confirms the imbalance. Two people dominate usage, and one person repeatedly cleans up. We need a system, not just a room.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Ryuji"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Ryuji: The data confirms the imbalance. Two people dominate usage, and one person repeatedly cleans up. We need a system, not just a room.""}]}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Ryuji, the imbalance is real, but the plasterboard is the true barrier. We need a place where difficult words can be spoken without an audience.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"Jonathan, privacy is nice, but I’m not paying for silence. I need a place to eat without losing my afternoon.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"May, silence costs money. Jonathan, privacy is a luxury. We are bleeding cash on a room that fails its primary function.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Shunichi, money is a measure, not a master. Jonathan, privacy is a need, not a luxury. Let us find a balance that honors both.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Jonathan, privacy is a valid need, but the tally shows the room is already overused. We must address the imbalance before adding new functions.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Ryuji, the imbalance is a symptom, not the cause. We need a space where difficult conversations can happen without an audience.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"Ryuji, the imbalance is real, but so is the twenty-five minute lunch walk. I need a place to eat without losing my afternoon.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Ryuji, the imbalance is a symptom of poor design. Jonathan, privacy is a luxury we cannot afford. We need a functional space, not a therapy room.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Ryuji, the imbalance is a symptom of unspoken needs. Jonathan, the plasterboard is a mirror, not a wall. Let us listen to what the silence demands.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree with Shunichi. We cannot afford luxury. The data shows a functional failure. We need a clear, equitable rule for usage, not a private sanctuary.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I hear the cost concerns, but the plasterboard failure is a safety issue. We need a space for difficult talks, not just a break room.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,I’m not paying for a therapy session. I need a place to eat without losing my afternoon.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Jonathan, plasterboard is not a safety issue. It is a budget leak. We need a functional space, not a therapy room.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,"Jonathan, the plasterboard is a mirror, not a wall. Let us listen to what the silence demands.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
